# Files this step owns, by name pattern (src/Simd/), for the capability-envelope
# check.  Derived from the stripper's own family map (tools/strip.py FAMILIES),
# so the set this gate inspects is exactly the set the step's base level had
# removed: `Simd<Isa><Family>*.{cpp,h}` for every back end, plus the family's
# private headers.  The gate adds src/Simd/SimdLib.cpp, the dispatch file the
# step's branches go back into.  One pattern per line; `*` is a glob.
*Hog*
